flowchart LR
    Plan[Attested preflight plan] --> Eval[Bracketed eval orchestration]
    Eval --> Witness[Listener, process, and executable witness]
    Witness --> ListenerTable[Kernel listener view]
    Eval --> Session[Single retained HTTP/1 session]
    Session -->|One owned client socket| Endpoint[Loopback endpoint]
    Endpoint --> Runtime[User-managed Ollama process]
    Session -->|Reverse 4-tuple before traffic and after each response| ConnectionView[Kernel connection view]
    ConnectionView -->|Windows context PID or Linux conditional visible holder| Witness
    Session --> Preflight[Ordered read-only Ollama requests]
    Eval --> Report[Inert point-in-time response evidence: qualified false]

